  "adaptations": [
    "Unavailable bone_arrow/snipe use the existing piercing_arrow kit.",
    "Rallying Shout substitutes for war_cry/rallying_howl. No obedience, command or morale system is claimed.",
    "Pyrekeeper uses firebolt/fire_siege; Ritualist firebolt/ember_blast. Unported area-control spells are deferred.",
    "Matron uses a melee/rally kit; ally triage and greater_mending deferred.",
    "Chaser uses skewer/pinning_spear; hanging_volley and dash coordination deferred.",
    "Ravener uses carve/deep_carve/rend; no tactical dash decision.",
    "Bullwarden is an original minotaur expansion; Rrakhan adapts the commander silhouette.",
    "Butcher omits prototype swig. Horncaller uses heavy_strike with rallying_shout instead of wake_the_scree.",
    "Gorer emphasizes minotaur mass; Khan adds an existing ground_slam to its melee/rally kit. These are adaptations, not complete prototype ports.",
    "Packfather adapts Rrakhan as one champion body, with heavy_strike/ground_slam/rallying_shout; detachable commander parts and crusade verbs are deferred."
